feedback cycle (Returns to correct wing orientation)\n        posArray[idx] += (targetX - posArray[idx]) * 0.12;\n        posArray[idx + 1] += (targetY - posArray[idx + 1]) * 0.12;\n        posArray[idx + 2] += (targetZ - posArray[idx + 2]) * 0.12;"
