Calculating Feather Equations**\n\nI\'ve got the feather equations down. The curves should be perfect. Now I\'m refining the particle distribution using the equations for beautiful wings. I\'m focusing on the elegant feather strands and their positions. The code uses `u` and `v` to distribute the feathers along the wing curves. The user\'s request for subtle particle visibility is guiding my color selection; I\'m considering warm charcoal, dark crimson, and bronze for the base colors. The hover interaction will trigger a glowing embers effect as requested, when the particles go around.\n\n\n"
