    modified_response: "I have successfully completed your requested enhancements and applied creative visual modifications:\n\n### Core Upgrades\n\n1. **Enhanced Perlin Noise Vector Field**:\n   - **Longer, Whispering Filaments**: Elongated the trajectory queue to **50 points**, creating endless, wind-blown glowing ribbons.\n   - **Gentle Fluid Flow Velocity**: Reduced the velocity limits (`0.35` to `1.0`) so that the field develops in a serene, luxurious, and cinematic tempo rather than a fast crawl.\n   - **More Interactive Suction**: Extended the attraction gravity sweep radius to **520px**. Particles now elegantly accelerate and warp as they approach your cursor, making mouse hover movements interactive.\n   - **Rich Cinematic Core Shimmer**: Replaced standard cores with dual-pass neon filament rendering (a soft wider red neon shadow underlying a high-intensity bright coral-white center line).\n\n2. **Creative Headings & Typography**:\n   - **Floating Premium Badge**: Injected a glassmorphic micro-badge at the apex (`INTERACTIVE DESIGN ATELIER`) with a pulsing neon accent node.\n   - **Majestic Heading Scale**: Enlarged the main display name **\"Sohaib Elahi\"** up to `text-6xl sm:text-8xl md:text-[8rem] lg:text-[8.5rem]` in high-contrast editorial serif.\n   - **Bigger & Stronger Body Font**: Scaled the conversion statement description up to a highly legible, premium size (`text-sm sm:text-base md:text-[16.5px]`) in deep, high-contrast zinc to maximize readability.\n\n3. **Glow-Infused Interactive CTA Buttons**:\n   - Added a dual-button interactive call-to-action bar:\n     - **\"Initiate Briefing\"** primary CTA button glowing with an active crimson shadow that reacts to hover interactions.\n     - **\"Explore Showcase\"** glossy glassmorphic button that smoothly scrolls your screen down straight into the Case Study Showcase Carousel.\n\n4. **Highly Creative Dialogue Terminal inputs**:\n   - Redesigned the outbound input fields and the **Inquiry Brief** message area inside the contact terminal. They now feature translucent deep-shadow canvases with responsive outline borders that flash standard accent red on focus."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
